          "heading": "Integrated design conversation",
          "content": "## Integrated design conversation\n\nImagine that the site data are incomplete and construction will begin in phases. Construct two defensible interpretations of the subsurface conditions. For each, state the best estimate of the controlling material parameter and a credible low and high value. Explain how a field observation or laboratory test could reject one interpretation. The deliverable is not only a number but a documented chain from field evidence to calculation, checking, and the resulting construction choice."
