          "heading": "Outcomes",
          "content": "## Outcomes\n\nAfter completing this unit the learner should be able to define the governing state variables, calculate representative quantities with correct units, explain when the idealized relation breaks down, interpret the corresponding laboratory models, and defend a field investigation or verification decision."
